{"slug": "software-buying-checklist", "title": "Software Buying Checklist for Field Service Businesses (Printable)", "description": "Printable checklist for choosing field service software: quoting, scheduling, routing, invoicing, real cost, processing fees and data export.", "h1": "Software buying checklist for field service businesses", "keyword": "field service software checklist", "type": "checklist", "tools": [], "trades": [], "body": "<style>.sub{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px 16px;margin:1rem 0}.sub h2{margin:0 0 .3rem;font-size:1.1rem}.sub p{margin:.2rem 0 .6rem;color:var(--mut)}.sub .lbl{flex-basis:100%;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}.sub .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.sub input[type=email]{flex:1 1 220px;padding:9px 12px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font:inherit}.sub button{padding:9px 16px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.sub button:hover{background:var(--brand-d)}.ck{padding-left:0}.ck li{margin:.4rem 0;list-style:none}.ck input{margin-right:.5rem}@media print{header,footer,.trust,.noprint,h2#faq-h{display:none}}</style><p>A practical checklist for cleaning, lawn, pool, pest, window and pressure washing businesses choosing scheduling, quoting and invoicing software. Tick items as you go, or print it and take it to demos.</p><p class='noprint'><button type='button' onclick='window.print()'>Print or save as PDF</button></p><form action=\"https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/stackguide\" method=\"post\" class=\"embeddable-buttondown-form sub noprint\"><h2>Get updates</h2><p>Occasional emails when software prices change or we publish a new guide. Unsubscribe anytime.</p><div class=\"row\"><label for=\"bd-email\" class=\"lbl\">Email address</label><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" id=\"bd-email\" required placeholder=\"you@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"tag\" value=\"tradestackguide\"><button type=\"submit\">Get updates</button></div></form><h2>1. Must-have features</h2><ul class='ck'><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Quotes or estimates customers can approve online</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Scheduling and dispatch with a drag-and-drop calendar</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Recurring jobs and routes (weekly pool, monthly pest, lawn cycles)</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Route optimization if you drive more than a few stops a day</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Invoicing with card and ACH payments, plus automatic reminders</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Field mobile app that works with poor signal, with photos, checklists and notes</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Job costing: track labor and materials against the quote</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Integration with your accounting software (QuickBooks or Xero)</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Trade-specific records if needed: chemical logs (pool and pest) or before/after photos</label></li></ul><h2>2. Real cost</h2><ul class='ck'><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Write down your number of users or technicians today and in 12 months; many tools charge per user</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Get the published monthly price at <em>both</em> counts, in writing if it's quoted</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask for the card processing rate and per-transaction fee, and whether you can use your own processor</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask whether there's a platform fee or revenue percentage on top of processing</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>List the add-ons you'd need (branded app, website, texting, extra locations or users) and their monthly prices</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Confirm contract length, auto-renewal, cancellation notice and any setup or exit fee</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask whether annual billing is discounted and whether the discount is refundable if you leave</label></li></ul><h2>3. Your data</h2><ul class='ck'><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Confirm you can export customers, payment history and notes yourself, in CSV, at any time</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask who moves your data in, what it costs, and how long it takes</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask how stored cards or recurring billing move over without customers re-entering cards</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Check what happens to your data after you cancel and for how long you can download it</label></li></ul><h2>4. Trial and decision</h2><ul class='ck'><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Start a trial and run one real week through it, not just the demo</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Test the mobile app as a staff member and as a customer</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Time how long the most common task takes (booking, check-in, quoting)</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Contact support once during the trial and note how fast and useful the answer is</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask two current users in your niche (forums, local groups) what they'd change</label></li></ul><p class='noprint'>Compare published prices: <a href=\"/compare/jobber-vs-housecall-pro/\">Jobber vs Housecall Pro</a> · <a href=\"/best/pool-service-software/\">pool service software</a> · <a href=\"/best/pest-control-software/\">pest control software</a> · <a href=\"/job-quote-estimator/\">job quote estimator</a></p>", "faq": [["What's the most overlooked cost in field service software?", "Per-user pricing and payment processing. Price it at the team size you'll have in a year, and ask for the card rate in writing."], ["Can I get the checklist as a PDF?", "Yes. Use the Print button and choose 'Save as PDF'."], ["Do I need route optimization?", "It's most useful when you run many recurring stops a day (pool, pest, lawn). For a few jobs a day, a good calendar may be enough."]]}